  .rl-toast { z-index: 70; }
  .rl-toast[hidden] { display: none; }
  /* A FLOATING toast, so the opaque fill and the shadow are honestly its own \u2014 a translucent soft
     alert over moving content would be unreadable. The RADIUS was not: 11px was an eleventh value for
